# 基本文章編集のかな漢字変換 (design 11.3), for tools/ui_run.py: the desktop's own and the
# process show the same composition and write the same record. Two copies of 基本文章編集 with
# 30 paragraphs (mkbig doc 30) are given the same keys, one in the desktop's text editor
# (docproc kernel) and one in the text editor running as a process (pdoc): the caret put in
# the second paragraph, かな typed after ひらがなカタカナ (the composition shown, the shot
# *_comp), Space converts it (*_conv), Enter commits it; then the text is written down the
# line (書式 / 縦書き in the menu opened at 300,250) and かな typed and converted again, the
# composition running down the line from the caret (*_vcomp, *_vconv), committed, 英数 back
# to letters, and saved. Record 0 of both must be the same, byte for byte; the shots
# (doc_ime_k_*, doc_ime_p_*) are compared afterwards inside the window, where the text is
# (101,125 to 682,482). The desktop's menu opens with 閉じる on the pointer's row the first
# time (書式 180 below) and with the item chosen last on it afterwards (the process's comes up
# so too, after the desktop's); 書式's own opens with its first row on 書式's row, 縦書き 140
# below.
# Keys: ひらがなカタカナ 88, Space 2C, Enter 28, 英数 39; Ctrl+S 16 01, Ctrl+E 08 01.
docproc kernel
mkbig doc 30
open big
waitwin 基本文章編集 600
sync 600
wait 500
click 300 170
sync 600
key 88
text kana
sync 600
move 690 490
sync 600
shot doc_ime_k_comp
key 2c
wait 800
sync 600
shot doc_ime_k_conv
key 28
sync 600
click 300 250 1
wait 400
wait 400
move 330 430
wait 300
move 440 430
wait 400
move 440 570
wait 300
click 440 570
sync 600
text kana
sync 600
move 690 490
sync 600
shot doc_ime_k_vcomp
key 2c
wait 800
sync 600
shot doc_ime_k_vconv
key 28
sync 600
key 39
sync 600
key 16 01
sync 600
sum show
keep kernel
key 08 01
sync 600
wait 500
mkbig doc 30
logmark
pdoc big
expectsincein 60 document: opened 基本文章編集 paragraphs 30
wait 800
logmark
click 300 170
expectsince document: drew
key 88
wait 300
logmark
text kana
expectsince document: key to screen
wait 500
move 690 490
wait 300
shot doc_ime_p_comp
logmark
key 2c
expectsince document: key to screen
wait 800
shot doc_ime_p_conv
logmark
key 28
expectsince document: key to screen
wait 300
logmark
click 300 250 1
expectsince document: menu
wait 400
move 330 250
wait 300
move 440 250
wait 400
move 440 390
wait 300
click 440 390
expectsince document: command dir.vert
expectsince document: drew
logmark
text kana
expectsince document: key to screen
wait 500
move 690 490
wait 300
shot doc_ime_p_vcomp
logmark
key 2c
expectsince document: key to screen
wait 800
shot doc_ime_p_vconv
logmark
key 28
expectsince document: key to screen
wait 300
key 39
wait 300
logmark
key 16 01
expectsince document: saved (0)
sum show
same kernel
key 08 01
expect document: closed
